  "description": "Smart, clever, and resourceful, Daon worked hard to overcome being poor. But his cheap ways are getting on the last nerve of his coworker, Sung-Hyeon, who hates him! After an incident with his own impoverished parents, Da-On is suddenly growing closer to Sung-Hyeon while balancing feelings for his former tutor, Jae-Min. With mixed emotions and unspoken secrets, will Da-On be rich with love or fall back into poverty? \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Chapter count includes 5 side story chapters.*",
